"Projects are listed from every account signed in under Artifacts, with the same sign-in. Graft only lists them; opening one takes you to claude.ai, where it is changed.\n\nclaude.ai is asked when this page is shown and when you refresh it, never in the background." = "Projects are listed from every account signed in under Artifacts, with the same sign-in. Graft only lists them; opening one takes you to claude.ai, where it is changed.\n\nclaude.ai is asked when this page is shown and when you refresh it, never in the background.";
"Searches the chats of every account signed in under Artifacts with claude.ai's own search, and their Code sessions by title and folder. Each search asks every account once, when you press Return; the filters only narrow what came back.\n\nWhere a Code session ran is read from this Mac's own transcripts. One whose transcript is here but which claude.ai no longer lists is shown as gone from claude.ai, and opens in Finder. A chat deleted on claude.ai is not kept anywhere and cannot be found." = "Searches the chats of every account signed in under Artifacts with claude.ai's own search, and their Code sessions by title and folder. Each search asks every account once, when you press Return; the filters only narrow what came back.\n\nWhere a Code session ran is read from this Mac's own transcripts. One whose transcript is here but which claude.ai no longer lists is shown as gone from claude.ai, and opens in Finder. A chat deleted on claude.ai is not kept anywhere and cannot be found.";
